      "createdAt": 1775901698958,
      "changelog": "- Introduces automatic context management that saves session state and delegates continuation to a subagent when usage reaches 80%.\n- Provides detailed auto-clear workflow, including session state checkpointing and task list reconciliation to prevent duplication.\n- Supports configuration of threshold and session state path through environment variables.\n- Detects and propagates execution mode (interactive, unattended, dangerous), ensuring the continuation agent behaves accordingly.\n- Optimizes integration with long-running or batch workflows, minimizing user intervention and context loss.",
